acceptance_criteria: "CI runs the pm health command with the strict-exit flag immediately after npm ci; the gate uses pm health rather than pm validate, because pm validate returns ok:true after a same-field merge silently discards a peer edit; the strict-exit flag is present so an ok:false health result fails the build"
close_reason: Added the pm health strict-exit CI step immediately after Install dependencies. Verified the gate exits 0 on a clean tree and exits 1 naming the affected item under pending_merge_decision_items on a reproduced same-field merge that discarded a peer title edit.
